  m_Name: Part_crew_seats
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OrionAR.PartInfo
  partId: crew_seats
  displayName: Crew Seats and Restraints
  shortName: Crew Seats
  zone: 1
  order: 100
  keySpec: "Four crew  \xB7  shock-attenuating pallet"
  summary: Four custom-fitted seats on a shock-attenuating pallet. They are the crew's
    primary protection during launch and splashdown, not just furniture.
  whyItMatters: "The seats are angled so acceleration is taken through the chest
    and back rather than along the spine \u2014 the direction the human body tolerates
    worst. The struts are tuned to each astronaut's mass, because a heavier crew
    member needs a different energy-absorbing profile to see the same deceleration."
  narration: {fileID: 0}
